          "path": "_m/9/q/8/y/sutro-tower-wk/perseid-meteor-over-sutro-towe.jpg",
          "filename": "Perseid meteor over Sutro Tower, San Francisco - Aug. 13, 2012.jpg",
          "caption": "I set up the camera to take 8 second exposures all night and caught this large meteor as it streaked over San Francisco.\nThe lights near the tower are cars shining their headlights into the fog on Twin Peaks.\nI happened to be checking on the camera when it happened so I saw it too!\n\nCheck out the EXIF info if you want to know the exact time, location, exposure, etc.",
          "alt": "I set up the camera to take 8 second exposures all night and caught this large meteor as it streaked over San Francisco.\nThe lights near the tower are cars shining their headlights into the fog on Twin Peaks.\nI happened to be checking on the camera when it happened so I saw it too!\n\nCheck out the EXIF info if you want to know the exact time, location, exposure, etc.",
          "width": 928,
          "height": 1302,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "CC BY 2.0",
          "artist": "trophygeek from San Francisco",
          "sourceUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Perseid_meteor_over_Sutro_Tower,_San_Francisco_-_Aug._13,_2012.jpg",
